{'symbol': 'LHX', 'date': '2023-03-06 10:00:00', 'title': 'L3HARRIS VIPER SHIELD ELECTRONIC WARFARE SYSTEM AWARDED LONG-LEAD MATERIAL CONTRACT TO ACCELERATE GLOBAL PRODUCTION', 'text': 'MELBOURNE, FLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--L3HARRIS TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: LHX) TODAY ANNOUNCED RECEIVING AN UNDEFINITIZED CONTRACT FROM LOCKHEED MARTIN TO PROCURE LONG-LEAD MATERIAL FOR THE VIPER SHIELD ELECTRONIC WARFARE SYSTEM TO ACCELERATE GLOBAL PRODUCT DELIVERY.'}